     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"de-DE\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"de-DE\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet mii-vs-mtb-immunohistochemistry-specific-codes</b></p><a name=\"mii-vs-mtb-immunohistochemistry-specific-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-vs-mtb-immunohistochemistry-specific-codes\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: de-DE</p></div><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  descends from 1234806008 (Observation using immunohistochemistry)</li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/55229-9/\">55229-9</a></td><td>Immune stain study</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/18474-7/\">18474-7</a></td><td>HER2 Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/48676-1/\">48676-1</a></td><td>HER2 [Interpretation] in Tissue</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/85319-2/\">85319-2</a></td><td>HER2 [Presence] in Breast cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/14228-1/\">14228-1</a></td><td>Cells.estrogen receptor/cells in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/14230-7/\">14230-7</a></td><td>Cells.progesterone receptor/cells in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/29593-1/\">29593-1</a></td><td>Cells.Ki-67 nuclear Ag/cells in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/33055-5/\">33055-5</a></td><td>Ki-67 nuclear Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/85330-9/\">85330-9</a></td><td>Cells.Ki-67 nuclear Ag/cells in Breast cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/83052-1/\">83052-1</a></td><td>PD-L1 by clone 22C3 [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/83055-4/\">83055-4</a></td><td>PD-L1 by clone 28-8 [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/83057-0/\">83057-0</a></td><td>PD-L1 by clone SP142 [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/81691-8/\">81691-8</a></td><td>DNA mismatch repair protein Mlh1 [Presence] in Cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/81692-6/\">81692-6</a></td><td>DNA mismatch repair protein Msh2 [Presence] in Cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/81693-4/\">81693-4</a></td><td>DNA mismatch repair protein Msh6 [Presence] in Cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/81694-2/\">81694-2</a></td><td>Mismatch repair endonuclease PMS2 [Presence] in Cancer specimen by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/14229-9/\">14229-9</a></td><td>P53 protein Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/47303-3/\">47303-3</a></td><td>Anaplastic lymphoma kinase Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/47021-1/\">47021-1</a></td><td>CDX2 Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/73910-2/\">73910-2</a></td><td>PAX8 Ag [Presence] in Tissue by Immune stain</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc